eight="44"><span><span class="nm">Joseph Bonaparte</span><span class="tp">1768–1844</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/charles-albert-of-sardinia"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/charles-albert-of-sardinia.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Charles Albert of Sardinia</span><span class="tp">1798–1849</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ramon-grau-san-martin"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ramon-grau-san-martin.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Ramón Grau San Martín</span><span class="tp">1881–1969</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
